48b; line-height: 1.5;">Developing and testing on airplanes, travel, or without corporate VPN is impossible with central databases.</p></div><div style="padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.15);"><div style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">📌</div><h4 style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-weight: 700; color: #2563eb;">🔒 Inflexibility &amp; Inter-Team Tickets</h4><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.5;">Developers cannot choose custom Oracle DB / APEX versions without long ticketing delays across DBA/Ops teams.</p></div></div><div style="padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;"><span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;">Quick Links:</span><a href="f?p=' || V('APP_ID') || ':1:' || V('APP_SESSION') || '" class="t-Button t-Button--simple t-Button--small">🌐 Live Services</a><a href="f?p=' || V('APP_ID') || ':3:' || V('APP_SESSION') || '" class="t-Button t-Button--simple t-Button--small">📋 Blueprints</a><a href="f?p=' || V('APP_ID') || ':4:' || V('APP_SESSION') || '" class="t-Button t-Button--simple t-Button--small">📖 Docs</a></div>';
